Onboarding 3 slides, Login, Sign up 5 steps, Account type selection, GPS permission, Interest categories, Interest goals, Client home feed, Client search, Client bookings, Provider home feed, Provider search, Provider camera, Video upload progress, Booking funnel 6 steps, Post-booking review, Reschedule selection + confirmation, Refund request, Public event page, Ticket purchase, Order summary, Payment success + QR, Digital ticket details, Event creation 5 steps, Event sales management, Ticket sales list, Promo codes management, Client profile, Client settings, Saved favorites, Provider profile, Provider QR code, Provider dashboard, Sales performance, Stripe Connect setup, Chat screen, Notifications history, QR scanner, Provider promo settings, Active tickets with cancel, Cancellation success/confirmation.

