## BASE DE DONNÉES (31 tables)

Tables principales : `profiles`, `providers`, `categories`, `services`, `bookings`, `events`, `tickets`, `ticket_types`, `videos`, `reviews`, `conversations`, `messages`, `payments`, `notifications`, `promo_codes`, `promo_code_uses`.

Tables additionnelles : `provider_availability`, `provider_blocked_dates`, `provider_settings`, `provider_categories`, `social_links`, `comments`, `booking_proposals`, `refunds`, `reports`, `notification_preferences`, `follows`, `video_likes`, `video_favorites`, `video_hidden`, `provider_favorites`.

RLS : Clients = propres données. Pros = données les concernant. Profils pros publics = lisibles par tous authentifiés. Messages = 2 participants uniquement.

